      <text>e's `the supplier has failed to comply with the undertaking` AND (CONSIDER e's `the undertaking enforced` WHEN `an undertaking to reimburse a specified body for costs or expenses incurred by it` THEN TRUE OTHERWISE FALSE)</text>
